 - GREEN GATES: accepted-root focused pytest passed 289 / skipped 4; full pytest passed 962 / skipped 6; the separate wheel-installed native macOS Go fixture passed all 6 scenarios; strict mypy passed 62 source files; tabnanny, trailing-whitespace, and diff hygiene passed. Green regression gates do not cover either reproduced boundary.
 - VERDICT: changes requested; route `to-dev`. Evidence and exact rework requirements are in `TASK-260720-2g21eg_review-verdict-cycle-3.md` plus the attached standard-library and hidden-mode probes.
